The UNL Olympiad is a series of competitions organised by the UNDL Foundation in order to foster the development of UNL-driven resources (dictionaries, grammars and corpora). The fourth edition of the Olympiad is devoted to the development of grammars and dictionaries for UNLizing (with [[IAN]]) and NLizing (with [[EUGENE]]) the corpus derived from the project [[AESOP|AESOP-A1]]. 

